{title: Lift up the name of Jesus, sing}
{x_theme: name-of-jesus, joy, praise}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Lift up the name of Jesus (songbook)(1).docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I’m gonna lift up the name of Jesus
I’m gonna sing of my joy since He came
I’m gonna tell of His power everyday and every hour
I’m gonna lift up that wonderful name

{comment: Verse 1}
Well you can talk about world conditions
You can talk about all that’s gone wrong
You can state your view and position
But I’m gonna sing me a song

{comment: Verse 2}
Well I don’t have time to worry
Heartaches I just can’t afford
I gotta sing and I’ll never be sorry
For praising the name of the Lord

{comment: Verse 3}
There are too many songs for singing
For me to be wearing a frown
There’s too much joy that He’s bringing
For me to ever be down
